WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.612 --> 00:00:09.278
Something smashed through the wall of the bank.

2
00:00:13.982 --> 00:00:16.144
smashed through the wall of the bank.

3
00:00:16.865 --> 00:00:18.527
Roxy stood in front of Detective Smith.

4
00:00:19.507 --> 00:00:20.949
Bricks and rubble bounced off her.

5
00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.933
When the dust cleared, Roxy saw a huge man on the sidewalk.

6
00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:28.656
His body was covered in armor.

7
00:00:29.856 --> 00:00:32.758
The armor on his back was huge and round, like a turtle shell.

8
00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.540
The man held a large bag.

9
00:00:37.462 --> 00:00:40.564
Using her x-ray vision, Roxy saw money inside the bag.

10
00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:43.546
Hank Tank had spotted Roxy.

11
00:00:44.407 --> 00:00:45.307
"Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:45.487 --> 00:00:45.988
he shouted.

13
00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:48.149
"You'll never stop me!"

14
00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:50.291
Roxy glared at the villain.

15
00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:52.693
"Yes, I will, Hank Tank!"

16
00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:56.956
"Never!" Hank Tank turned to run.

17
00:00:58.132 --> 00:01:00.214
Then he saw all the police cars in his way.

18
00:01:01.035 --> 00:01:02.456
He pressed a button on his chest.

19
00:01:02.476 --> 00:01:04.478
"Tank mode!"

20
00:01:04.759 --> 00:01:05.319
he shouted.

21
00:01:08.822 --> 00:01:09.683
His armor rumbled.

22
00:01:10.644 --> 00:01:13.947
Parts shifted and moved.

23
00:01:13.967 --> 00:01:15.469
Rubber tank treads popped out.

24
00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.012
Hank was now a rolling army tank!

25
00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:22.536
"Uh-oh!" cried Detective Smith.

26
00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.541
"I guess this is why he stole that army tank," said Roxy.

27
00:01:29.521 --> 00:01:32.362
"He used it to turn himself into a tank!"

28
00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:35.983
Brumm, brumm, brumm!

29
00:01:36.523 --> 00:01:38.524
Chug, chug, chug!

30
00:01:39.444 --> 00:01:41.245
Hank Tank rolled over the police cars.

31
00:01:42.785 --> 00:01:45.286
Crunch! Metal twisted.

32
00:01:45.306 --> 00:01:46.126
Windows shattered.

33
00:01:48.847 --> 00:01:52.628
"Ha-ha!" The villain laughed as he rolled down the street.

34
00:01:53.772 --> 00:01:55.153
He rolled over a mailbox.

35
00:01:55.814 --> 00:01:59.096
Crunch! He rolled over a hot dog stand.

36
00:01:59.576 --> 00:02:05.820
Smash! "My hot dogs are ruined!"

37
00:02:06.141 --> 00:02:07.121
cried the hot dog man.

38
00:02:07.141 --> 00:02:11.885
"I have to stop Hank Tank!"

39
00:02:12.085 --> 00:02:12.785
thought Roxy.

40
00:02:13.606 --> 00:02:15.047
She fired her eye laser beams.

41
00:02:15.887 --> 00:02:19.490
Whiz-hoo! The beams hit Hank Tank's shell.

42
00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.172
But they bounced off and hit a billboard.

43
00:02:23.256 --> 00:02:24.556
The billboard exploded.

44
00:02:25.697 --> 00:02:27.017
"Oops!" said Roxy.

45
00:02:27.037 --> 00:02:32.599
"My armor is too strong for your laser beams, Rocket Girl!"

46
00:02:32.859 --> 00:02:33.479
shouted Hank.

47
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.460
Bash! Crunch!

48
00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.161
Hank drove over more cars and then a taxi.

49
00:02:42.821 --> 00:02:44.482
Roxy flew toward Hank fast.

50
00:02:45.402 --> 00:02:46.362
She held out her fist.

51
00:02:47.763 --> 00:02:51.964
Bam! Hank slid across the street and knocked over a traffic light.

52
00:02:53.684 --> 00:02:57.266
"Hit me as hard as you want, Rocket Girl," said Hank Tank.

53
00:02:57.286 --> 00:03:00.568
"You'll never break my armor!"

54
00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.371
"Grr!" Roxy stomped her foot.

55
00:03:06.192 --> 00:03:08.153
Then she flew at Hank again and again.

56
00:03:08.693 --> 00:03:09.994
Bam! Bam!

57
00:03:10.815 --> 00:03:12.576
But Hank Tank kept rolling along.

58
00:03:12.596 --> 00:03:16.458
"Hank's armor is really strong!"

59
00:03:16.658 --> 00:03:17.338
thought Roxy.

60
00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:19.540
"How will I stop him?"

61
00:03:20.576 --> 00:03:23.057
Hank spun around and fired a rocket at Roxy.

62
00:03:23.997 --> 00:03:25.538
Roxy caught it and broke it in half.

63
00:03:25.558 --> 00:03:27.898
"Ha!" said Roxy.

64
00:03:27.918 --> 00:03:30.139
"You might have strong armor, Hank.

65
00:03:30.799 --> 00:03:32.680
But I am Rocket Girl!

66
00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.020
Nothing can hurt—oof!"

67
00:03:36.121 --> 00:03:37.521
A second rocket hit Roxy.

68
00:03:38.361 --> 00:03:39.662
She fell down with a thud.

69
00:03:40.622 --> 00:03:42.022
Hank Tank sped toward her.

70
00:03:42.042 --> 00:03:46.644
"I'm going to run right over you, Rocket Girl!"
